(5712794, 830860, 3214, '<td valign="top">Now that''s subtle, and I like it--the interaction is obviously with the photographer, as implied by the shadow.  But the shadow doesn''t overpower the rest of the shot, I like all the reflected fencing so nicely perpendicular with the backbround fence.</td>', 'Now that''s subtle, and I like it--the interaction is obviously with the photographer, as implied by the shadow.  But the shadow doesn''t overpower the rest of the shot, I like all the reflected fencing so nicely perpendicular with the backbround fence.', '2009-11-04 00:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
