(5713375, 831332, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice interaction with an old time feel, looks like the dog is reading the book.  Focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'Nice interaction with an old time feel, looks like the dog is reading the book.  Focus seems a little soft.', '2009-11-04 07:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
