(5713378, 831311, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice moment captured here, feels like an old picture, classic looking suits and setting add to that feeling.</td>', 'Nice moment captured here, feels like an old picture, classic looking suits and setting add to that feeling.', '2009-11-04 07:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713385, 831289, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling of motion, tough to get a good image of something like this, this isn''t frozen, maybe that''s what you were going for.  The angle seems a bit off to me, would like to have seen more from the front of the horse or the horse rising off the ground with the gate to the right of the frame.</td>', 'Nice feeling of motion, tough to get a good image of something like this, this isn''t frozen, maybe that''s what you were going for.  The angle seems a bit off to me, would like to have seen more from the front of the horse or the horse rising off the ground with the gate to the right of the frame.', '2009-11-04 08:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713388, 831389, 59737, '<td valign="top">lensbaby, good sharp focus on the dog, the oof areas make this better than just an in focus image for me.</td>', 'lensbaby, good sharp focus on the dog, the oof areas make this better than just an in focus image for me.', '2009-11-04 08:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713395, 831133, 59737, '<td valign="top">funny, good use of perspective to make an interesting picture. nice colors, a little bit of noise on the hand as you needed to expose for the eel.</td>', 'funny, good use of perspective to make an interesting picture. nice colors, a little bit of noise on the hand as you needed to expose for the eel.', '2009-11-04 08:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
