(5713399, 831400, 59737, '<td valign="top">Seems soft and not really in focus, maybe too much of a crop, this doesn''t really work for me.</td>', 'Seems soft and not really in focus, maybe too much of a crop, this doesn''t really work for me.', '2009-11-04 08:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
