(5714284, 831161, 108580, '<td valign="top">Not in the true spirit of the challenge imo. Animal is not alive or even stuffed. Saturation poor and street through window detracts from shot. Sorry! The only similarity I can see is that it''s a man made representation and fits the challenge in that way. Bumped one more point.</td>', 'Not in the true spirit of the challenge imo. Animal is not alive or even stuffed. Saturation poor and street through window detracts from shot. Sorry! The only similarity I can see is that it''s a man made representation and fits the challenge in that way. Bumped one more point.', '2009-11-04 16:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714288, 831354, 108580, '<td valign="top">Your dog is your best friend. Good to get him also looking at the camera. Shot meets challenge, but too much noise from the low lighting for my liking however.</td>', 'Your dog is your best friend. Good to get him also looking at the camera. Shot meets challenge, but too much noise from the low lighting for my liking however.', '2009-11-04 16:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714290, 831004, 61651, '<td valign="top">It''s a winner in my book.</td>', 'It''s a winner in my book.', '2009-11-04 16:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714292, 831345, 108580, '<td valign="top">I don''t see an animal? Only an invertebrate...Nice theme and setup and menacing spider but the model, if truly afraid, would be keeping an eye on the spider, not the camera (my opinion). B&amp;W PP is great as is DOF and contrast. Yes, I know that all creatures big and small are part of the ''Animal Kingdom'' :) I did not however vote it low.</td>', 'I don''t see an animal? Only an invertebrate...Nice theme and setup and menacing spider but the model, if truly afraid, would be keeping an eye on the spider, not the camera (my opinion). B&W PP is great as is DOF and contrast. Yes, I know that all creatures big and small are part of the ''Animal Kingdom'' :) I did not however vote it low.', '2009-11-04 16:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714338, 831242, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks to be a particularly cooperative one.  Would love to see more of his expression so I might have cropped this tighter.</td>', 'Looks to be a particularly cooperative one.  Would love to see more of his expression so I might have cropped this tighter.', '2009-11-04 17:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714341, 831117, 65234, '<td valign="top">You have to wait your turn!  Bet you''ll be a hit; you''ve got a really interesting face :-)</td>', 'You have to wait your turn!  Bet you''ll be a hit; you''ve got a really interesting face :-)', '2009-11-04 17:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714343, 831422, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sweetly intimate.  The body language speaks of making/being friends.  I might have preferred a solid  blanket but that''s a relative nit.</td>', 'Sweetly intimate.  The body language speaks of making/being friends.  I might have preferred a solid  blanket but that''s a relative nit.', '2009-11-04 17:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714355, 831004, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute matching grins :-)</td>', 'Very cute matching grins :-)', '2009-11-04 17:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
