(5714788, 831311, 108982, '<td valign="top">Really loved this picture, reminds me of the old Rat-Pack.  Excellent subject for B &amp; W, save one issue.  The Groom, dog and first fellow to the dog''s right (as viewed) get a little lost in the shuffle against the large white flowers.  this would have scored big with me if you had shortened the DOF to give the flowers a more mottled appearance or shifted the angle a bit to lose the flowers.  At any rate, great picture!</td>', 'Really loved this picture, reminds me of the old Rat-Pack.  Excellent subject for B & W, save one issue.  The Groom, dog and first fellow to the dog''s right (as viewed) get a little lost in the shuffle against the large white flowers.  this would have scored big with me if you had shortened the DOF to give the flowers a more mottled appearance or shifted the angle a bit to lose the flowers.  At any rate, great picture!', '2009-11-04 22:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
