(5717873, 831307, 98141, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit harsh, dof is too inclusive... A little more invention and attention to quality details would take this subject further here. Try a different angle, from below the dog or above the groomer, to give it a unique feel, rather than a snapshot feel that anybody could achieve. If you want to score well, you have to stand out from the crowd a bit.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit harsh, dof is too inclusive... A little more invention and attention to quality details would take this subject further here. Try a different angle, from below the dog or above the groomer, to give it a unique feel, rather than a snapshot feel that anybody could achieve. If you want to score well, you have to stand out from the crowd a bit.', '2009-11-07 17:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
