(5718897, 830571, 63269, '<td valign="top">A very interesting take on the challenge. I''m sure everyone will bomb you with "dnmc"''s, but I like this. It''s as if I myself, as the viewer, am the person doing the interacting with the animal. A very unique perspective, one that makes me think of the photograph in an entirely new way... :)I also am attracted by the bizarre colors and ghostly light - they seem to add to the whole irony.</td>', 'A very interesting take on the challenge. I''m sure everyone will bomb you with "dnmc"''s, but I like this. It''s as if I myself, as the viewer, am the person doing the interacting with the animal. A very unique perspective, one that makes me think of the photograph in an entirely new way... :)I also am attracted by the bizarre colors and ghostly light - they seem to add to the whole irony.', '2009-11-08 13:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718898, 831161, 63269, '<td valign="top">A different angle, maybe less harsh colors and a little better focus, and this might have been a very intriguing photo. I like how the person is half cropped off...</td>', 'A different angle, maybe less harsh colors and a little better focus, and this might have been a very intriguing photo. I like how the person is half cropped off...', '2009-11-08 13:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718899, 831456, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lighting''s a little harsh, but very clever concept! It might be nice if the human reflection was a little bigger, but I''m sure this was an extremely difficult shot to get anyway.</td>', 'Lighting''s a little harsh, but very clever concept! It might be nice if the human reflection was a little bigger, but I''m sure this was an extremely difficult shot to get anyway.', '2009-11-08 13:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718901, 831196, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love this so much. The rich contrasts and tones, the black and white... delightful. And the interaction you''ve captured between person and dog is unique and intricate. 9  :)</td>', 'I love this so much. The rich contrasts and tones, the black and white... delightful. And the interaction you''ve captured between person and dog is unique and intricate. 9  :)', '2009-11-08 13:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
