(5718904, 831221, 63269, '<td valign="top">This might have more impact if it were brighter and had stronger contrast, so that the white shades in the photo were really white instead of gray.</td>', 'This might have more impact if it were brighter and had stronger contrast, so that the white shades in the photo were really white instead of gray.', '2009-11-08 13:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
