(5718911, 831451, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little harsh here... maybe you used a flash? I might suggest setting the camera on a stable surface and just capturing the natural light, with a long exposure. Usually then the light is a little softer and prettier. Just a thought.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little harsh here... maybe you used a flash? I might suggest setting the camera on a stable surface and just capturing the natural light, with a long exposure. Usually then the light is a little softer and prettier. Just a thought.', '2009-11-08 14:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
