(5718915, 831236, 63269, '<td valign="top">I admit I''m not big on the title, but that''s not terribly important, perhaps. I like the black and white, the composition, lighting, and that dog''s silly expression... :)</td>', 'I admit I''m not big on the title, but that''s not terribly important, perhaps. I like the black and white, the composition, lighting, and that dog''s silly expression... :)', '2009-11-08 14:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718924, 831369, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition seems a bit rough, but this is wonderful! way too neat. The motion of the popcorn (?) dropping, the way the squirrel is half hidden, everything is so intriguing. Like we''re catching a glimpse of the animal/human intereaction, just enough to catch our attention, but no more.</td>', 'The composition seems a bit rough, but this is wonderful! way too neat. The motion of the popcorn (?) dropping, the way the squirrel is half hidden, everything is so intriguing. Like we''re catching a glimpse of the animal/human intereaction, just enough to catch our attention, but no more.', '2009-11-08 14:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718927, 831296, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful. The clean, simple lines, the arrogant tilt of the cat''s head, the extended neck of the person, all speak of incredible elegance. That delicate lighting is wonderful too. Simply marvelous!</td>', 'This is so beautiful. The clean, simple lines, the arrogant tilt of the cat''s head, the extended neck of the person, all speak of incredible elegance. That delicate lighting is wonderful too. Simply marvelous!', '2009-11-08 14:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718930, 831132, 63269, '<td valign="top">Fascinating concept...!</td>', 'Fascinating concept...!', '2009-11-08 14:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718933, 831331, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really, really love the vintage-grainy editing. And something about the way the man''s face is so open, so clear, and yet the little dog''s face is obscured by fur, is also very intriguing.</td>', 'I really, really love the vintage-grainy editing. And something about the way the man''s face is so open, so clear, and yet the little dog''s face is obscured by fur, is also very intriguing.', '2009-11-08 14:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718941, 831347, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I care for the lighting and the focus seems a bit off, but the whole concept seems delightfully absurd - what a clever twist on the challenge theme. Something about the way the gentleman appears to be elegantly dressed in a suit, contrasted with the utterly gruesome pig''s feet or whatever they are, is bitingly ironic. Add the pricetag, and you have a most curious photo.</td>', 'I''m not sure I care for the lighting and the focus seems a bit off, but the whole concept seems delightfully absurd - what a clever twist on the challenge theme. Something about the way the gentleman appears to be elegantly dressed in a suit, contrasted with the utterly gruesome pig''s feet or whatever they are, is bitingly ironic. Add the pricetag, and you have a most curious photo.', '2009-11-08 14:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718945, 830860, 63269, '<td valign="top">The black and white is so perfect for this, and all the interplay of the shadows is delightful. Plus I love your concept, the goat''s smile, everything. :)</td>', 'The black and white is so perfect for this, and all the interplay of the shadows is delightful. Plus I love your concept, the goat''s smile, everything. :)', '2009-11-08 14:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718946, 831400, 63269, '<td valign="top">I think that if the quality of the photo had been a little higher, and maybe the lighting a little nicer, this would have been a very nice photo! great capture. the black and white is a nice touch, too.</td>', 'I think that if the quality of the photo had been a little higher, and maybe the lighting a little nicer, this would have been a very nice photo! great capture. the black and white is a nice touch, too.', '2009-11-08 14:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718948, 831438, 63269, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness! This is too funny - what a terrific capture. The way that dog is just exploding out of the snow, lol! Would be nice perhaps if the human interaction part was a emphasized a litle stronger though...</td>', 'Oh my goodness! This is too funny - what a terrific capture. The way that dog is just exploding out of the snow, lol! Would be nice perhaps if the human interaction part was a emphasized a litle stronger though...', '2009-11-08 14:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
