(5720795, 831456, 99346, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot, and is my hope for a blue. The way you show the interaction via the reflection in the eye is especially clever - it demonstrates a certain obediance and devotion in the dog - the way it''s eyes seem so utterly fixed on the person. I''ll admit that I''m biased being a huge fan of dogs, but even so this shot stands out above the other dog photo''s I''ve looked at from this challenge.</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot, and is my hope for a blue. The way you show the interaction via the reflection in the eye is especially clever - it demonstrates a certain obediance and devotion in the dog - the way it''s eyes seem so utterly fixed on the person. I''ll admit that I''m biased being a huge fan of dogs, but even so this shot stands out above the other dog photo''s I''ve looked at from this challenge.', '2009-11-09 18:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
