(5721240, 831031, 106806, '<td valign="top">Welll.... initially I thought the dog wasn''t posed (as it were) that well but then the emotion of this photo hit me, closely followed by the composition hotly pursued by skill of the exposure. This is a truly lovely photograph, the sort that will colour the way I feel for the rest of this day. Keep that camera out in ready in this place, I''m just thinking a bit of the dogs face would make an allready wonderfull image even better.</td>', 'Welll.... initially I thought the dog wasn''t posed (as it were) that well but then the emotion of this photo hit me, closely followed by the composition hotly pursued by skill of the exposure. This is a truly lovely photograph, the sort that will colour the way I feel for the rest of this day. Keep that camera out in ready in this place, I''m just thinking a bit of the dogs face would make an allready wonderfull image even better.', '2009-11-10 03:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
