(5721925, 831354, 67258, '<td valign="top">You even look like each other! Despite the questionable technical quality of the photo, this scores for communicating the clear connection between animal and person.</td>', 'You even look like each other! Despite the questionable technical quality of the photo, this scores for communicating the clear connection between animal and person.', '2009-11-10 16:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
