(5722128, 831345, 65025, '<td valign="top">Creative, cute and funny. It doesn''t quite seem sharp and the cropping seems a little off.</td>', 'Creative, cute and funny. It doesn''t quite seem sharp and the cropping seems a little off.', '2009-11-10 20:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722133, 831159, 65025, '<td valign="top">Love it! It''s nice and sharp, the depth of field really brings you into the main subject, and the crop is nice and tight. The composition is great as well.</td>', 'Love it! It''s nice and sharp, the depth of field really brings you into the main subject, and the crop is nice and tight. The composition is great as well.', '2009-11-10 20:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722137, 830462, 65025, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I like how the background has little color. I makes the bird and hand stand out. There''s also a great amount of detail in the hand, you can see the pores and hair.</td>', 'Very interesting. I like how the background has little color. I makes the bird and hand stand out. There''s also a great amount of detail in the hand, you can see the pores and hair.', '2009-11-10 20:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722161, 830212, 65025, '<td valign="top">Love how the pink coat and boots pop out of the almost black and white scene. The snow is also nice, how it''s falling, though some of the flakes on the left and right make it look like the camera lens is blurry. 8</td>', 'Love how the pink coat and boots pop out of the almost black and white scene. The snow is also nice, how it''s falling, though some of the flakes on the left and right make it look like the camera lens is blurry. 8', '2009-11-10 21:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
