(5723597, 830546, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of your shot. You''ve basically used the rule of thirds to establish an inner border to the picture. A piece of life advice after reading others'' comments on your pictures - just because some people come across as know-it-alls and eager to tell people what to do, does not mean their input is not valid, or not worth listening to. Learn what you can. Ignore the rest. You''ve done a great job of capturing a meaningful moment. <br/></td>', 'I like the composition of your shot. You''ve basically used the rule of thirds to establish an inner border to the picture. A piece of life advice after reading others'' comments on your pictures - just because some people come across as know-it-alls and eager to tell people what to do, does not mean their input is not valid, or not worth listening to. Learn what you can. Ignore the rest. You''ve done a great job of capturing a meaningful moment. ', '2009-11-11 16:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
